{"4983810": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BRAWLZERK", "steam_appid": 4983810, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BRAWLZERK</strong> is an isometric action roguelite that combines the survivors-like formula with fighting game-style offense and defense. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don't just evade the oncoming enemies. Attack, block, and counter to take control of the fight.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983810/extras/2502fff13515dac09c93043ee748c1a0.poster.avif?t=1787707688\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983810/extras/2502fff13515dac09c93043ee748c1a0.webm?t=1787707688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983810/extras/2502fff13515dac09c93043ee748c1a0.mp4?t=1787707688\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chain Your Moves and Crush the Horde</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain your moves against the oncoming enemies, counter their attacks, and drive them all the way to the wall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Land three consecutive Perfect Guards to stun every enemy on the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983810/extras/71c199234ecd71737816a13ee116cf18.poster.avif?t=1787707688\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983810/extras/71c199234ecd71737816a13ee116cf18.webm?t=1787707688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983810/extras/71c199234ecd71737816a13ee116cf18.mp4?t=1787707688\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Keep the Pressure On and Turn the Fight Around</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your offense going with air combos, combos against downed enemies, and wall combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break out of danger and counterattack with a Guard Reversal or a Reversal after a perfectly timed dodge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983810/extras/819b9f7d38d6ed2a570d890e6f82ff48.poster.avif?t=1787707688\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983810/extras/819b9f7d38d6ed2a570d890e6f82ff48.webm?t=1787707688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983810/extras/819b9f7d38d6ed2a570d890e6f82ff48.mp4?t=1787707688\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combine Active Cards and Passives.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine Active Skill Cards with Passive Rewards to create a new fighting style every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983810/extras/a6e77adbf1c44fa400e69a1d78fe6104.poster.avif?t=1787707688\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983810/extras/a6e77adbf1c44fa400e69a1d78fe6104.webm?t=1787707688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983810/extras/a6e77adbf1c44fa400e69a1d78fe6104.mp4?t=1787707688\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Read Their Moves and Strike Back</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your enemies won't just stand there and take it. Some rush in to pressure you, some keep their distance and fire arrows, while others block your attacks. Read their moves, time your response, and strike back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983810/extras/4466b2ed9b68211371fd19469c712f26.poster.avif?t=1787707688\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983810/extras/4466b2ed9b68211371fd19469c712f26.webm?t=1787707688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983810/extras/4466b2ed9b68211371fd19469c712f26.mp4?t=1787707688\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Isometric Hack-and-Slash Survivors-Like</strong><br><br>Plunge into the unrelenting horde and fight through fast, intense battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fighting Game-Style Offense, Defense, and Combos</strong><br><br>Take direct control of the flow of battle with light and heavy basic attacks, a variety of active skills, air combos, wall combos, Guard, Perfect Guard, dodge rolls, perfectly timed dodges, and Reversal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemy Patterns That Demand a Response</strong><br><br>Read enemies that attack, charge, pressure you from range, or guard, then respond to each situation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Active Skill Cards and Passive Builds</strong><br><br>Combine Active Skill Cards with Passive Rewards to create a new fighting style every run.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Read the enemy. Block. Dodge. Strike back.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BRAWLZERK</strong> is an isometric action roguelite that combines the survivors-like formula with fighting game-style offense and defense. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don't just evade the oncoming enemies. Attack, block, and counter to take control of the fight.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983810/extras/2502fff13515dac09c93043ee748c1a0.poster.avif?t=1787707688\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983810/extras/2502fff13515dac09c93043ee748c1a0.webm?t=1787707688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983810/extras/2502fff13515dac09c93043ee748c1a0.mp4?t=1787707688\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chain Your Moves and Crush the Horde</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain your moves against the oncoming enemies, counter their attacks, and drive them all the way to the wall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Land three consecutive Perfect Guards to stun every enemy on the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983810/extras/71c199234ecd71737816a13ee116cf18.poster.avif?t=1787707688\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983810/extras/71c199234ecd71737816a13ee116cf18.webm?t=1787707688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983810/extras/71c199234ecd71737816a13ee116cf18.mp4?t=1787707688\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Keep the Pressure On and Turn the Fight Around</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your offense going with air combos, combos against downed enemies, and wall combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break out of danger and counterattack with a Guard Reversal or a Reversal after a perfectly timed dodge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983810/extras/819b9f7d38d6ed2a570d890e6f82ff48.poster.avif?t=1787707688\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983810/extras/819b9f7d38d6ed2a570d890e6f82ff48.webm?t=1787707688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983810/extras/819b9f7d38d6ed2a570d890e6f82ff48.mp4?t=1787707688\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combine Active Cards and Passives.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine Active Skill Cards with Passive Rewards to create a new fighting style every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983810/extras/a6e77adbf1c44fa400e69a1d78fe6104.poster.avif?t=1787707688\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983810/extras/a6e77adbf1c44fa400e69a1d78fe6104.webm?t=1787707688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983810/extras/a6e77adbf1c44fa400e69a1d78fe6104.mp4?t=1787707688\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Read Their Moves and Strike Back</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your enemies won't just stand there and take it. Some rush in to pressure you, some keep their distance and fire arrows, while others block your attacks. Read their moves, time your response, and strike back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983810/extras/4466b2ed9b68211371fd19469c712f26.poster.avif?t=1787707688\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983810/extras/4466b2ed9b68211371fd19469c712f26.webm?t=1787707688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983810/extras/4466b2ed9b68211371fd19469c712f26.mp4?t=1787707688\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Isometric Hack-and-Slash Survivors-Like</strong><br><br>Plunge into the unrelenting horde and fight through fast, intense battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fighting Game-Style Offense, Defense, and Combos</strong><br><br>Take direct control of the flow of battle with light and heavy basic attacks, a variety of active skills, air combos, wall combos, Guard, Perfect Guard, dodge rolls, perfectly timed dodges, and Reversal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemy Patterns That Demand a Response</strong><br><br>Read enemies that attack, charge, pressure you from range, or guard, then respond to each situation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Active Skill Cards and Passive Builds</strong><br><br>Combine Active Skill Cards with Passive Rewards to create a new fighting style every run.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Read the enemy. Block. Dodge. Strike back.</strong></p>", "short_description": "BRAWLZERK is an isometric action roguelite that combines the survivors-like formula with fighting game-style offense and defense. Attack, block, dodge, and keep your combos going, then combine Active Skill Cards with Passive Rewards to create a new fighting style every run.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983810/1a8e6451509ef493b4f73073ec6e769168d21550